name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-ar[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]AXE Chop Reports[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Selecting a chop on the ACE AXE tab shows a beautiful, colored, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]width-responsive report of that run — a universal result card for [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]every chop plus an optional chop-authored report document — and all[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]four bugyi-chops scripts publish rich reports of their own.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]axe_chop_reports.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-ar[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page:[/dim]\n[#87AFFF]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-ar/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Chop report document in the Rust core[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: add the optional `report` block document to the chop result [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]wire in sase-core, with a closed block/tone/glyph vocabulary, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fail-closed bounds validation, and Rust tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ChopReport builder in the sase.chops SDK[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]sdk[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]sdk: add a typed `ChopReport` builder plus `ChopResultBuilder.report` to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the public `sase.chops` SDK so chop packages compose reports without [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hand-writing JSON or markup, and document the contract in docs/axe.md.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]AXE chop-run result card and report rendering[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: build the shared block renderer and repaint the AXE chop-run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]detail pane as RESULT card, REPORT, then OUTPUT, width-responsive and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cached, and reuse the same renderer for `sase axe chop run`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]PNG snapshot coverage for chop reports[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]visual[dim] · [dim][/dim]after render[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual: add AXE-tab PNG snapshot fixtures and goldens covering a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]report-rich run, a report-less run, a failing run, and a narrow [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]terminal.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Reports for every bugyi-chops chop[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chops[dim] · [dim][/dim]after sdk[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chops: author reports for ci_watch, toobig_split, recent_bug_audit, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]recent_improvement_audit in the bugyi-chops repo behind one shared house[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]style, and unify toobig_split's clan summary with its report.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end verification on the real AXE tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after visual, chops[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: run each bugyi chop against the real configuration, confirm the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]AXE tab renders each report correctly at several widths, and confirm no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi config change is required.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-ar","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-ar.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-77dcb7fcaa181ce041ed5634717c3e87","started_at":"2026-07-29T13:51:10.236138+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1785335279,"sha":"bc501e595b0ee0e09d915daf68b7528b1bc50a84","subject":"feat(axe): render structured chop result reports"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"ae7263c364c585a8a835f8e1b890d4820aa1e3b6159da501aa1de9ad21e11f75","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/chat.md","size_bytes":7177},"commits":{"digest":"bbb2cd1632b991c5d9dd6cbefc38995980050b38e14f5445ca25b87989ae61ea","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/commits.json","size_bytes":226},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"d4ec400246f05c3758c09d6ee4583421e31cd8839149390791baa780c07e8fa3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/meta.json","size_bytes":603},"prompt":{"digest":"0124972062d215f60e3b037824b2577238a51203260fe254b7b6fdc1b1fe8fa2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":154},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"770167a751c516584863835b22281a945b4fff8837e7b6f51d2edb53b179c0e9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":12000},"state":{"digest":"adc6959f53e0da9dc38155c9f9a0d31305545370c96306370824196861e55b41","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3/state.json","size_bytes":183}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-ar.3","local_name":"sase-ar.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-ar","agent_clan_generation":"20260729095055","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-ar.3"